  "description": "Centuries ago, Mago was punished by a god for writing a calamitous book. She was doomed to be repeatedly reborn until she destroyed every copy of her novel under the surveillance of Ha Lib, the deity's errand boy. There are now only five copies remaining, but Mago's quest to end her cycle of rebirth is complicated when Do Kyujin, a charismatic CEO, joins the search for his own purposes. With yet another mysterious figure thwarting them at every turn, will Mago finally be able to rest in peace? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
